1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,120
One day a great whale opened its mouth... and Caspion was swallowed whole!

2
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:19,730
Whale: Oops. Hello, little fish. Let me get you out of there.

3
00:00:20,530 --> 00:00:24,170
Caspion: Whoa! What a ride!

4
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:28,510
A bubble carried Caspion up towards the light.

5
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:46,460
Pelican: Hop in, little one. I know a place where the world is dry!

6
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:55,260
And up they went, over the waves and over the land.

7
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:05,720
Policeman: A fish in the sky! Now I have seen everything.

8
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:12,240
Caspion: Hello down there! The world is simply wonderful, wet or dry!

